      },
      "lineNbr": 391,
      "author": {
        "id": 9545
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-03-24T23:40:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If you agree that we should allow these two metadata OBUs to be layer-specific, we can make this change now. An application can still conform to the current draft AV1 spec update by using a non-layer-specific insert flag for these two metadata OBUs. On the other hand, once the check is shipped in a libaom release, an application won\u0027t be able to use a layer-specific insert flag if that libaom release is used.",
      "parentUuid": "82ca528a_9ad5164d",
      "revId": "9182de0a11cf28074759cc6bf6c34971916d56ab",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
